[
  {
    "id": 0,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "う、ぐうっ……重い、一撃だな……",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Urgh... That hit like a hammer..."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "ジェロン",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Geron"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 1,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "や、やめろ！！",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "S-stop it!!"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "ティム",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Tim"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 2,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "ん？",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Hmm?"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "ヘルト",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Held"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 3,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "ティム……！",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Tim...!"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "ジェロン",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Geron"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 4,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "兄さんに、手を出すな！！",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Don't you dare touch my brother!!"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "ティム",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Tim"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 5,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "ティムくん、危ないです……！",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Tim, it's too dangerous...!"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "レスナ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Resna"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 6,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "ここ、今度は、僕が兄さんを守るんだ……！",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "This time... I'm going to protect him...!"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "ティム",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Tim"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 7,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "恐怖に震えながらも、必死で兄をかばう、か……\nいい心がけだな、弟のかがみってやつだ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Even trembling with fear, you desperately shield your brother... Admirable. A model younger sibling."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "ヘルト",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Held"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 8,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "兄者？",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Brother?"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "ゼロ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Zero"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 9,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "気が変わった。ゼロ、戦闘は中止だ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "I've changed my mind. Zero, we're calling off the fight."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "ヘルト",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Held"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 10,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "え、ええ……？",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Wh-what...?"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "ヴァレリア",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Valeria"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 11,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "なぜじゃ！\u3000我は暴れ足りぬぞ！\u3000足～り～ぬ～！！",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "What?! I haven't had my fill yet! Not! Enough!!"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "ゼロ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Zero"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 12,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "まあ落ち着け。俺に考えがある。せっかく楽しみを\n味わうなら、一番美味しく食べたいだろう？",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Calm yourself. I have an idea. If we're going to enjoy ourselves, we should savor the best parts, no?"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "ヘルト",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Held"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 13,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "ほう。何か思いついたんじゃな？\n兄者は昔っから頭が良いからのお",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Oho. You've thought of something? Brother's always been the clever one."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "ゼロ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Zero"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 14,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "な、何が起こってるの……？",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Wh-what's happening...?"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "アルビーナ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Alvina"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 15,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "俺は寛大だからな。ティムくんの兄弟愛に免じて\n一度だけお前たち自身で物事を決める機会をくれてやる",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "I'm feeling generous. In honor of young Tim's fraternal devotion, I'll grant you the chance to decide your own fate. Just this once."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "ヘルト",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Held"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 16,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "腑抜けた妹たちに代わり、お前ら人類の手で\nクリセルダたち不穏分子を「管理」しろ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "In place of our spineless sisters, you humans will 'manage' the troublemakers — Criselda and her ilk — yourselves."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "ヘルト",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Held"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 17,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "そ、そんなっ……！",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Y-you can't be serious...!"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "レスナ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Resna"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 18,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "期限は１週間だ。それまでに「管理」してなかったら\n今度こそ俺たちが手を下す",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "You have one week. If they're not 'managed' by then, we'll take matters into our own hands."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "ヘルト",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Held"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 19,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "ほら帰るぞ、ゼロ、キューン",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Come on, Zero. Quinn. We're leaving."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "ヘルト",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Held"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 20,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "う、うん……",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "O-okay..."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "キューン",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Quinn"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 21,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "……１週間は助かった、のか……",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "...We bought ourselves a week... I guess..."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "アルビーナ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Alvina"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 22,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "あっ、とと……",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Ah, ugh..."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "アルビーナ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Alvina"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 23,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "大丈夫？\u3000アルビーナ、すっごい汗よ？",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "You okay? You're drenched in sweat."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "ヴァレリア",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Valeria"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 24,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "な、なんとか……暗黒の氷海のあいつらに比べりゃ、\nまだ言葉が通じる相手だもん。大丈夫なはず……",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "I-I'll manage... At least they could talk, unlike those things in the Midnight Sea. I should be fine..."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "アルビーナ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Alvina"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 25,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "……言葉が通じる相手なんかじゃないんだよ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "...They're not the kind you can reason with."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "シトリン",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Citrine"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 26,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "僕が言うのもなんだけど、あの通り\nヘルトは昔から超が付く気分屋なんだよ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "I hate to say it, but as you saw, Held's always been ridiculously temperamental."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "シトリン",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Citrine"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 27,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "もう生き物というか、異常気象の領域だよ。\nその荒々しさと読めなさっていう意味でね",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "He's less like a living being and more like a natural disaster. Violent and completely unpredictable."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "シトリン",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Citrine"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 28,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "僕たち兄弟は振り回されっぱなしだし、\nゼロも血の気が多くて話し合いには応じない",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Us siblings get swept up in it constantly, and Zero's too bloodthirsty to ever negotiate."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "シトリン",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Citrine"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 29,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "昔から戦いが大好きで、自分が九偉人で最強だと\n思っているからなぁ、ゼロ姉は",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "She's always loved fighting. Convinced she's the strongest of the Nine."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "イェルカ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Jelka"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 30,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "ゼロってのは０番目ってこと……じゃないのよね？\nそんな口ぶりしてたわ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Zero doesn't mean she's number zero, does it? That's not what she was implying."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "アルビーナ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Alvina"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 31,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "本当は２番目のホムンクルスなんだけど\n１番のヘルトより強いって自称してるのさ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "She's actually the second homunculus, but she calls herself stronger than Held, number one."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "シトリン",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Citrine"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 32,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "確かに、そう自称するのも頷ける強さだった……",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "After seeing her in action... I can see why she'd claim that..."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "アルビーナ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Alvina"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 33,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "そんなわけで、話が通じるとは思わないほうがいい。\nあっち側からの一方通行で、大変なんだよ……",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Bottom line—don't expect to reason with them. It's a one-way street on their terms. Always has been..."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "シトリン",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Citrine"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 34,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "おいおい、なんなんだあいつらは……\nとんでもない奴らが来ちまったな……",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "What the hell were those guys...? This just got a whole lot worse..."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "ジョゼ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "José"
        }
      }
    }
  }
]